</surname><given-names>J.A.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mutations in the gene encoding lamin A/C cause autosomal dominant Emery-Dreifuss muscular dystrophy</article-title><source>Nat. Genet.</source><volume>21</volume><year>1999</year><fpage>285</fpage><lpage>288</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10080180</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Bulfieldetal1984"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bulfield</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Siller</surname><given-names>W.G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Wight</surname><given-names>P.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Moore</surname><given-names>K.J.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>X chromosome-linked muscular dystrophy (mdx) in the mouse</article-title><source>Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA.</source><volume>81</volume><year>1984</year><fpage>1189</fpage><lpage>1192</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6583703</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Ellenbergetal1997"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ellenberg</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Siggia</surname><given-names>E.D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Moreira</surname><given-names>J.E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>C.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Presley</surname><given-names>J.F.</given-names></name><name><surname>Worman</surname><given-names>H.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Lippincott-Schwartz</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Nuclear membrane dynamics and reassembly in living cellstargeting of an inner nuclear membrane protein in interphase and mitosis</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>138</volume><year>1997</year><fpage>1193</fpage><lpage>1206</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9298976</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Ellisetal1998"><citation citation-type="jo